    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτράφαξυς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰτρᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span>, ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>orach, Atriplex rosea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.1.2
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.633
			</span></i>. (The correct form is implied by the compound 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδ-ατράφαξυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					630
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				565.17
			</span></i>; other spellings are <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδράφαξυς</span></b>  (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδρ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					539.5
				</span></i>
			) Thphr.l.c., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράφαξυς</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> l.c., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτράφαξις</span></b> 
			v.l.
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.843
			</span></i>, cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.539
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.49
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				467
			</span></i>.)</div>
